OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers celebrate ride on
OL,4,Arevived bus route
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers in a part of Nottinghamshire
OL,7,Fhave been celebrating the first journey
OL,8,Fof a bus route that was scrapped when
OL,9,Fthe previous operator ceased trading.
OL,11,FNottingham Minibuses and Coaches took
OL,12,Fover the 300, which links villages
OL,13,Fbetween Lowdham and Newark, after the
OL,14,Fcollapse of Community Transport for
OL,15,FNottingham (CT4N) in August.
OL,17,FTwo journeys will run in each direction
OL,18,Fbetween Lowdham, Southwell and Newark
OL,19,Fon Mondays, Wednesdays and Fridays.
OL,21,FResidents had mounted a campaign for
OL,22,Fthe route to return.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
